// A2AService: the Agent-to-Agent protocol adapter
// (.agents/spec/09-a2a-and-hive.md, "Core methods"). A2A is a thin protocol
// shim over the existing WorkflowService, not a second engine: an A2A "task"
// is a CairnOS "run", so CreateTask starts a run, GetTask reads one,
// ListTasks lists them, CancelTask stops one, and TaskUpdates streams a run's
// events. SendMessage adds the conversational half: a peer holds a multi-turn
